<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine pesos ends down on T-bill rate fall.</title>
<headline>Philippine pesos ends down on T-bill rate fall.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>--------------------------- March 10 -------------------------</p>
<p>*Peso average at 26.326 from 26.320</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>The sharp fall in Treasury bill rates on Monday pulled down the Philippine peso at the close to 26.329 from 26.323, traders said.</p>
<p>The peso had fallen to as low as 26.333 in mid-day trades after the government said the benchmark 91-day Treasury bill rate plunged to 10.159 from 10.564 percent in the primary auction.</p>
<p>But dollar inflows later helped the peso recover some lost ground, they said.</p>
</text>
